{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We can\u2019t save the world alone - the OSA needs you, soldier. Enlist now by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 Remastered!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it\u2019s better in every way.<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve been giving it everything we\u2019ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong>\u00a0- no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1757082567\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Q3 2025 to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we\u2019re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1757082567\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719740?t=1757082567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/7067149fb0400ee98601661fd6c930805eb5f25c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757082567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/f81b6d5080cee68a8b31cdae03c0b698691685ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757082567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/f81b6d5080cee68a8b31cdae03c0b698691685ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757082567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"First person shooter violence and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We can\u2019t save the world alone - the OSA needs you, soldier. Enlist now by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 Remastered!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it\u2019s better in every way.<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve been giving it everything we\u2019ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong>\u00a0- no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1757082567\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Q3 2025 to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we\u2019re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1757082567\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>","developers":["XREAL Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/94fa6c8b89605bd75bba386c399803be7d6c574e/header.jpg?t=1757082567","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requiremen